WEBVTT

00:18:56.496 --> 00:19:01.829
He's always grooming him. It's really
nice to him. He never attacks him.

00:19:02.079 --> 00:19:05.621
He rushes them to protect him.
Another male challenges him.

00:19:06.329 --> 00:19:11.163
And because of that, these
two then become so strong

00:19:11.329 --> 00:19:18.413
an alliance that nothing breaks it. And
I think just absolutely fascinating.

00:19:19.746 --> 00:19:24.663
Wow. Yeah, and then the other kind
of alliance is a temporary one,

00:19:25.246 --> 00:19:30.246
so two males are wanting perhaps,
I don't know,